# A teleport (a spot picked from the menu, or a scenario's next leg) in the middle of a manual or a
# grind (phase 26, found by skate feel --tour: tour-hayes's E leg ends on a seat wall grind). The
# teleport put the skater in the air but left the manual (and a grind's state) on it: landing at the
# new spot, the old manual carried on, ending there ("stopped", its 120 points banked at the new spot),
# and a leftover grind fed a balance bot a meter that never moved. A teleport now ends them: no
# manual at the new spot, nothing banked.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..80
tap up 100
tap down 104
cmd 160 teleport lab_ledge
bot balance
run 400
expect event manualStart{trick=Manual} within 104..106
expect no event manualStart within 107..400
expect no event manualEnd
expect no event comboLanded
expect no event bail
